  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Navbar Components**\n\nI\'m now building out the Navbar components. Currently, I\'m focusing on the \"Pearls Elegance\" branding with its serif subtext \"Thrift Abaya Wears\". The desktop navigation links are Home, Shop, New Arrivals, Wholesale, About, and Contact. Finally, there\'s a prominent \"Order on WhatsApp\" button on the right side.\n\n\n**Developing Mobile Components**\n\nI\'ve shifted focus to mobile components. I\'m building a clean, sticky bar with a hamburger menu, logo, and search. Then, a highly conversion-focused sticky bottom bar with WhatsApp CTA, quick view for bag/inquiry, and quick categories. I\'m also planning authentic footer details, incorporating business location, contact, WhatsApp link, Google Rating, and operational information. I\'ll also be focusing on the TrustRatingBadge, ProductCard and ProductDetailModal components.\n\n\n"
