  planner_response {
    response: "I have built a mobile-first e-commerce and catalog website for **Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears**, tailored specifically for modest fashion shoppers and wholesale resellers in Ijebu Ode, Ogun State, and across Nigeria.\n\n### Highlights of What Was Created\n\n- **Visual & Brand Identity**:\n  - **Color Palette**: Warm ivory (`#FAF8F5`), soft cream (`#F5EFE6`), rich charcoal (`#1C1917`), and muted metallic gold accents (`#C5A059`).\n  - **Typographic Pairing**: *Cormorant Garamond* for modest luxury serif headlines paired with *Plus Jakarta Sans* for crisp, legible body text.\n  - **High-Quality Photography**: Authentic visuals capturing classic abayas, modern 2-piece kinomo sets, adult jalabiyas, kiddies wear, and thrift gowns.\n\n- **Storefront Architecture & Navigation**:\n  - **Home Page**: Features an editorial hero banner with the trust line *\"Based in Ijebu Ode, Ogun State \342\200\242 Delivering across Nigeria\"*, featured categories, current product pricing in Nigerian Naira (\342\202\246), the *\"Why Shop with Pearls Elegance\"* quality guarantee (handpicked Grade-A pieces, washed, steam-ironed, and neatly packed), a wholesale reseller teaser, and the verified **5.0 Google Rating from 1 review**.\n  - **Shop / Catalog**: Complete searchable catalog with live category pills (*Abayas, Jalabiyas, Kinomo, Kiddies Wear, Thrift Tops & Gowns, New Arrivals, Wholesale*), price range filter, sorting options, and stock availability badges.\n  - **New Arrivals**: Dedicated showcase with *\"Freshly Added\"* badges spotlighting fresh shipments of abayas (\342\202\24612,000), adult jalabiyas (\342\202\2466,000), and kinomo inner dress sets.\n  - **Wholesale & Reseller Hub**: Dedicated page titled *\"Stock Your Store With Affordable Modest Fashion\"* catering to boutique owners and online vendors with bulk bales, waybill delivery across Nigeria, and a custom wholesale inquiry form.\n  - **About Page**: Tells the authentic journey of making modest fashion accessible without high price tags.\n  - **Store & Contact Page**: Location details for *Ibadan Garage Side, Ijebu Ode, 120101, Ogun State*, one-tap calling (`0811 244 4087`), Google Maps directions, opening hours, and an instant inquiry composer.\n\n- **Nigerian Mobile Experience & WhatsApp Integration**:\n  - **Seamless WhatsApp Ordering**: Generates pre-filled messages: `\"Hello Pearls Elegance, I\'m interested in [PRODUCT NAME] priced at [PRICE]. Is it still available?\"`\n  - **Multi-Item Inquiry Drawer**: Shoppers can select multiple pieces and send a single consolidated inquiry to WhatsApp to check availability for all items simultaneously.\n  - **Persistent Mobile Bar**: Floating bottom action bar optimized for Nigerian mobile shoppers with quick access to the Catalog, Inquiry Basket, and instant WhatsApp ordering.\n  - **SEO & Structured Data**: Complete Schema.org `ClothingStore` JSON-LD structured data and targeted meta tags for local search discovery in Ogun State and nationwide."
    thinking: "**Verifying Output Compliance**\n\nOkay, I\'ve checked the final result against the original requirements. The business name, type, and location are all accurately reflected. I\'m satisfied that everything checks out, and that all the specifications were addressed. I think it meets the necessary criteria.\n\n\n"
