    user_response: "I have already built the website for Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears.\n\nDo NOT rebuild the project from scratch.\n\nInstead, perform a professional production-readiness audit and refinement of the existing implementation.\n\nBUSINESS:\nPearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears\n\nLOCATION:\nIbadan Garage Side, Ijebu Ode, 120101, Ogun State, Nigeria\n\nPHONE / WHATSAPP:\n0811 244 4087\n\nWHATSAPP:\nhttps://wa.me/2348112444087\n\nCURRENT VERIFIED GOOGLE INFORMATION:\n- Clothing store in Ijebu Ode\n- 5.0 Google rating from 1 review\n- Products shown on Google include:\n  - Thrift Tops and Gowns \342\200\224 \342\202\2462,000\n  - Kiddies Abaya and Jalabia \342\200\224 \342\202\2466,000\n  - Thrift Abaya Wears \342\200\224 \342\202\2469,000\n- Recent Google business updates mention:\n  - New arrivals clean white adults jalabia \342\200\224 \342\202\2466,000\n  - New arrivals Abaya \342\200\224 \342\202\24612,000\n  - Thrift kinomo abaya with new inner dress \342\200\224 \342\202\24610,000\342\200\223\342\202\24615,000\n- Business description states that they sell affordable thrift abayas, jalabiyas, and modest fashion for women and men, serve customers across Nigeria, and offer wholesale/bulk purchase options for resellers and boutique owners.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nOnly use factual business information that has actually been provided.\n\nREMOVE, CHANGE, OR FLAG any unsupported claims such as:\n- \342\200\234Grade-A pieces\342\200\235\n- \342\200\234bulk bales\342\200\235\n- guaranteed nationwide delivery\n- specific delivery methods such as waybill unless confirmed\n- fabricated years of experience\n- fabricated customer numbers\n- fabricated testimonials\n- fabricated reviews\n- fabricated awards/certifications\n- invented opening hours\n- invented product availability\n\nDo not create fake social proof.\n\n==================================================\nPRIMARY OBJECTIVE\n==================================================\n\nTake the existing website and make it feel like a polished, credible, premium Nigerian modest-fashion e-commerce/catalog website that is ready to show to a real client.\n\nThe website should communicate:\n\nAFFORDABLE + ELEGANT + MODEST + TRUSTWORTHY + EASY TO ORDER\n\nIt must NOT feel like:\n- an AI-generated template\n- a SaaS dashboard\n- a generic fashion template\n- an overly luxurious designer brand\n- a cyberpunk/futuristic interface\n- an over-animated website\n\n==================================================\nDESIGN SYSTEM\n==================================================\n\nKeep the existing visual direction, but refine consistency.\n\nColors:\n- Warm Ivory #FAF8F5\n- Soft Cream #F5EFE6\n- Rich Charcoal #1C1917\n- Muted Metallic Gold #C5A059\n\nTypography:\n- Cormorant Garamond for editorial/serif headings\n- Plus Jakarta Sans for body text and UI\n\nMake spacing, typography, card sizing, buttons, borders, shadows, radii, and section rhythm consistent throughout the site.\n\nUse gold as a restrained accent, NOT as an overwhelming color.\n\nMaintain a sophisticated editorial fashion aesthetic.\n\n==================================================\nHOME PAGE\n==================================================\n\nReview the hero section carefully.\n\nIt should immediately communicate:\n\n\342\200\234Elegant modest wear at accessible prices.\342\200\235\n\nUse a strong headline such as:\n\n\342\200\234Elegant Modest Wear, Beautifully Within Reach.\342\200\235\n\nSupporting copy:\n\n\342\200\234Discover affordable thrift abayas, jalabiyas, dresses, and modest fashion pieces for women, men, and kids.\342\200\235\n\nPrimary CTA:\n\342\200\234Shop New Arrivals\342\200\235\n\nSecondary CTA:\n\342\200\234Order on WhatsApp\342\200\235\n\nMaintain the trust line:\n\n\342\200\234Based in Ijebu Ode, Ogun State \342\200\242 Delivering across Nigeria\342\200\235\n\nOnly keep \342\200\234Delivering across Nigeria\342\200\235 if this is confirmed by the current business information.\n\nAdd a highly visible New Arrivals section directly after the hero or near the top of the page.\n\nThe visitor should quickly understand:\n1. What the business sells\n2. Where it is located\n3. That products are affordable\n4. That they can order through WhatsApp\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT CATALOG\n==================================================\n\nAudit the Shop page.\n\nEnsure:\n- Search works correctly\n- Category filters work\n- Price filtering works\n- Sorting works\n- Availability filtering works\n- Product cards are consistent\n- Images maintain correct aspect ratios\n- Mobile scrolling/filter UX is excellent\n\nCategories:\n- Abayas\n- Jalabiyas\n- Kinomo\n- Kiddies Wear\n- Thrift Tops & Gowns\n- New Arrivals\n- Wholesale\n\nEach product card should clearly show:\n- Image\n- Product name\n- Price in \342\202\246\n- Category where appropriate\n- Availability\n- View Product\n- Order on WhatsApp\n\nTHRIFT INVENTORY REQUIREMENT:\n\nThe system must be easy to maintain because thrift inventory changes frequently.\n\nEach product should support:\n- available\n- sold out\n- hidden/unlisted\n- new arrival\n\nDo not allow obviously unavailable products to appear as purchasable.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT DETAIL PAGE\n==================================================\n\nMake the product page feel premium and trustworthy.\n\nInclude:\n- Large product imagery\n- Image gallery\n- Product name\n- Price\n- Availability\n- Description\n- Size information if available\n- Color information if available\n- Product details when known\n- WhatsApp order CTA\n\nWhatsApp message should be dynamically generated:\n\n\342\200\234Hello Pearls Elegance, I\'m interested in [PRODUCT NAME] priced at [PRICE]. Is it still available?\342\200\235\n\nDo not claim stock availability unless the data says it is available.\n\n==================================================\nINQUIRY BASKET\n==================================================\n\nThe existing multi-item WhatsApp inquiry feature should remain.\n\nAudit it carefully.\n\nFlow:\n\nProduct\n\342\206\222 Add to Inquiry\n\342\206\222 Inquiry Basket\n\342\206\222 Review Selected Items\n\342\206\222 Send WhatsApp Inquiry\n\nThe generated message should list all selected products clearly, for example:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\'m interested in the following items:\n\n1. [Product Name] \342\200\224 \342\202\246[Price]\n2. [Product Name] \342\200\224 \342\202\246[Price]\n\nPlease let me know if they are currently available.\n\nThank you.\n\nMake sure:\n- Items can be removed\n- Quantity can be adjusted if appropriate\n- Basket survives navigation\n- Empty state works\n- WhatsApp URL is correctly encoded\n\n==================================================\nWHOLESALE PAGE\n==================================================\n\nKeep the wholesale/reseller page.\n\nPosition it for:\n- Boutique owners\n- Resellers\n- Online fashion vendors\n- Bulk buyers\n\nHeadline:\n\n\342\200\234Stock Your Store With Affordable Modest Fashion.\342\200\235\n\nDo not invent wholesale minimum quantities, bale sizes, prices, delivery methods, or guarantees.\n\nUse a simple inquiry form:\n\nName\nBusiness Name\nPhone Number\nProducts Interested In\nQuantity Needed\nMessage\n\nCTA:\n\342\200\234Send Wholesale Inquiry\342\200\235\n\nAlso provide direct WhatsApp contact.\n\n==================================================\nABOUT PAGE\n==================================================\n\nKeep the tone authentic.\n\nFocus on:\n- affordable modest fashion\n- thrift clothing\n- elegance\n- accessibility\n- customer service\n- Ijebu Ode location\n- customers across Nigeria\n- wholesale/bulk availability\n\nAvoid making up a founder story, company history, years in operation, or achievements.\n\n==================================================\nSTORE / CONTACT\n==================================================\n\nDisplay:\n\nPearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears\n\nIbadan Garage Side,\nIjebu Ode,\n120101, Ogun State, Nigeria\n\nPhone:\n0811 244 4087\n\nWhatsApp:\nhttps://wa.me/2348112444087\n\nInclude:\n- Call button\n- WhatsApp button\n- Google Maps/directions button\n- Address\n- Contact information\n\nDo not invent business hours.\n\nIf hours are not verified, either remove them or clearly mark them as unavailable rather than guessing.\n\n==================================================\nMOBILE EXPERIENCE\n==================================================\n\nThis is a MOBILE-FIRST website.\n\nTest every major screen at approximately:\n- 320px\n- 375px\n- 390px\n- 430px\n- tablet\n- desktop\n\nThe persistent mobile action bar should remain useful but must NEVER cover content or important buttons.\n\nCheck:\n- sticky/fixed elements\n- overflow\n- horizontal scrolling\n- text wrapping\n- product card layout\n- image cropping\n- filter usability\n- navigation\n- inquiry basket\n- WhatsApp CTA\n\nButtons must be large enough for touch interaction.\n\n==================================================\nAUTHENTICITY\n==================================================\n\nUse real business information.\n\nDo not generate:\n- fake reviews\n- fake testimonials\n- fake customer photos\n- fake sales numbers\n- fake statistics\n- fake social media followers\n- fake certifications\n\nThe verified trust information is:\n\n5.0 Google Rating\n1 Google Review\n\nDisplay this accurately.\n\n==================================================\nSEO\n==================================================\n\nAudit the existing SEO implementation.\n\nEnsure:\n- unique title tags\n- useful meta descriptions\n- proper H1/H2 hierarchy\n- semantic HTML\n- descriptive image alt text\n- canonical URLs where appropriate\n- Open Graph metadata\n- Twitter/X metadata where appropriate\n- favicon\n- robots.txt\n- sitemap\n- local business schema\n- product schema where appropriate\n\nTarget relevant search intent such as:\n- Abaya in Ijebu Ode\n- Thrift Abaya Ijebu Ode\n- Jalabiya Ijebu Ode\n- Modest wear Ogun State\n- Affordable abaya Nigeria\n- Thrift fashion Nigeria\n- Wholesale abaya Nigeria\n\nDo not keyword stuff.\n\n==================================================\nPERFORMANCE\n==================================================\n\nAudit the website for production performance.\n\nOptimize:\n- image loading\n- image dimensions\n- lazy loading\n- font loading\n- JavaScript bundle size\n- unnecessary dependencies\n- layout shift\n- animations\n- mobile performance\n\nAvoid loading unnecessarily large images.\n\nUse modern image formats where appropriate.\n\n==================================================\nACCESSIBILITY\n==================================================\n\nAudit:\n- color contrast\n- keyboard navigation\n- focus states\n- semantic buttons\n- image alt text\n- form labels\n- screen-reader labels\n- accessible modals/drawers\n- mobile touch targets\n\n==================================================\nTECHNICAL QUALITY\n==================================================\n\nReview the existing codebase for:\n- duplicated components\n- inconsistent styling\n- unnecessary state\n- broken links\n- console errors\n- warnings\n- dead code\n- poor component boundaries\n- hardcoded values that should be centralized\n- mobile bugs\n- hydration/rendering issues where applicable\n\nPreserve the existing architecture where reasonable.\n\nDo not introduce unnecessary complexity.\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT FINAL PASS\n==================================================\n\nAfter making the improvements, perform a full end-to-end review as if this website were about to be presented to a paying client.\n\nCheck:\n\nHOME\nSHOP\nPRODUCT DETAIL\nNEW ARRIVALS\nWHOLESALE\nABOUT\nCONTACT\nINQUIRY BASKET\nWHATSAPP FLOW\nMOBILE NAVIGATION\nDESKTOP NAVIGATION\nSEO\nPERFORMANCE\nACCESSIBILITY\n\nFix actual issues you find rather than only reporting them.\n\nThe final result should feel like a real, polished Nigerian fashion storefront built by a professional web development agency.\n\nDo not redesign it into something unrelated to the current brand.\n\nPreserve the strong parts of the existing implementation and improve weak areas."
