  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Audit Analysis**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the codebase, pinpointing areas that need refinement based on a recent audit. The focus is laser-sharp on factual integrity and ensuring all claims are thoroughly vetted and sound. My primary objective is removing outdated, inaccurate, or unsupported data. This process will create a solid foundation for all further work.\n\n\n**Refining Authenticity & Accuracy**\n\nI\'ve just finished replacing overly promotional terms with more accurate descriptions. The \"Grade-A\" language has been entirely excised in favor of terms such as \"Hand-selected,\" and \"Quality-checked.\" I am now focusing on the product descriptions. I\'ve also replaced all instances of \"bales\" and invented store hours with factual information regarding wholesale purchases, and store visit policies. I\'ve also re-written the delivery specifics to avoid any unconfirmed promises.\n\n\n**Verifying Catalog & Availability**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into product verification. The goal is complete alignment with Google information. I\'m cross-referencing product details, ensuring accurate pricing and naming. I\'m also implementing the product state requirements: \"available,\" \"few left,\" \"sold out,\" \"hidden/unlisted,\" and \"new arrival.\" My priority is ensuring accurate product state display. This involves changes to disable actions, display badges, and incorporate filters for availability.\n\n\n**Constructing Hero & CTAs**\n\nI\'m currently crafting the hero section. I\'ve formulated the headline, supporting text, and primary CTA, \"Shop New Arrivals,\" which will link directly to, or scroll down to the \"New Arrivals\" section. The secondary CTA, \"Order on WhatsApp,\" is also in place, along with a concise trust line. I\'m focusing on ensuring these elements clearly communicate what the business offers and where it is located. Now, I will implement the new arrivals section directly after the hero. I will also construct the message formats for WhatsApp to ensure the customer has an easy purchasing experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Functional Navigation**\n\nI\'ve been working on core functionality and data management, and I\'ve ensured seamless operation with local storage for cart adjustments and deletions. I am also working on creating a new, compelling wholesale page. It includes a clear headline and a simple inquiry form for bulk buyers. I\'m focusing on providing authentic information, removing any invented details. Also, the about page has been completely refactored with the correct information about the company. The contact page now correctly displays the store address, along with phone and WhatsApp links. I am also updating the experience for mobile devices.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 873356433
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
