  planner_response {
    response: "The production-readiness audit and refinement for **Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears** is complete:\n\n### 1. Visual Identity & Hero Optimization\n- **Harmonized Color Palette**: Refined the color system using Warm Ivory (`#FAF8F5`), Soft Cream (`#F5EFE6`), Deep Charcoal (`#1C1917`), and Muted Metallic Gold (`#C5A059`), paired with Cormorant Garamond display typography and Plus Jakarta Sans body font.\n- **Hero Messaging**: Updated headline to *\"Elegant Modest Wear, Beautifully Within Reach.\"* with supporting copy: *\"Discover affordable thrift abayas, jalabiyas, dresses, and modest fashion pieces for women, men, and kids.\"*\n- **Hero CTAs**: Positioned primary **Shop New Arrivals** and direct **Order on WhatsApp** buttons, complemented by the location badge (*\"Based in Ijebu Ode, Ogun State \342\200\242 Delivering across Nigeria\"*).\n\n### 2. Layout Structure & New Arrivals Placement\n- **New Arrivals Spotlight**: Positioned directly beneath the Hero section for immediate visibility of recent arrivals, including clean white adult jalabias (\342\202\2466,000), new arrival abayas (\342\202\24612,000), and thrift kinomo 2-piece sets with matching inner dresses (\342\202\24610,000\342\200\223\342\202\24615,000).\n- **Streamlined Catalog Organization**: Provided quick-filter category pills for *Abayas*, *Jalabiyas*, *Kinomo Sets*, *Kiddies Wear*, *Thrift Tops & Gowns (from \342\202\2462,000)*, and *Wholesale / Bulk*.\n\n### 3. Factual Transparency & Social Proof\n- **Google Business Rating**: Formatted to reflect **5.0 stars from 1 Google review** without exaggeration or simulated review counts.\n- **Store Location & Hours**: Grounded all contact and pickup info in the store\'s location at *Ibadan Garage Side, Ijebu Ode, 120101, Ogun State, Nigeria*, with notes on in-store visits and delivery across Nigeria.\n- **Sanitized Product Claims**: Cleaned all product and marketing descriptions, emphasizing careful hand-selection, washing, steam-ironing, and neat packaging.\n\n### 4. Direct WhatsApp Ordering & Reseller Desk\n- **Single-Item & Batch WhatsApp Inquiries**: Implemented structured, pre-filled WhatsApp message generation for single pieces and multi-item orders.\n- **Wholesale & Reseller Desk**: Configured the wholesale section with headline *\"Stock Your Store With Affordable Modest Fashion.\"*, structured inquiry form fields (*Name, Business Name, Phone Number, Products Interested In, Quantity Needed, Message*), and direct WhatsApp submission.\n\n### 5. SEO & Structured Data\n- **Schema.org Structured Data**: Configured valid `ClothingStore` JSON-LD schema with address coordinates for Ijebu Ode, Nigerian price ranges, and verified aggregate rating in `index.html`."
    modified_response: "The production-readiness audit and refinement for **Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears** is complete:\n\n### 1. Visual Identity & Hero Optimization\n- **Harmonized Color Palette**: Refined the color system using Warm Ivory (`#FAF8F5`), Soft Cream (`#F5EFE6`), Deep Charcoal (`#1C1917`), and Muted Metallic Gold (`#C5A059`), paired with Cormorant Garamond display typography and Plus Jakarta Sans body font.\n- **Hero Messaging**: Updated headline to *\"Elegant Modest Wear, Beautifully Within Reach.\"* with supporting copy: *\"Discover affordable thrift abayas, jalabiyas, dresses, and modest fashion pieces for women, men, and kids.\"*\n- **Hero CTAs**: Positioned primary **Shop New Arrivals** and direct **Order on WhatsApp** buttons, complemented by the location badge (*\"Based in Ijebu Ode, Ogun State \342\200\242 Delivering across Nigeria\"*).\n\n### 2. Layout Structure & New Arrivals Placement\n- **New Arrivals Spotlight**: Positioned directly beneath the Hero section for immediate visibility of recent arrivals, including clean white adult jalabias (\342\202\2466,000), new arrival abayas (\342\202\24612,000), and thrift kinomo 2-piece sets with matching inner dresses (\342\202\24610,000\342\200\223\342\202\24615,000).\n- **Streamlined Catalog Organization**: Provided quick-filter category pills for *Abayas*, *Jalabiyas*, *Kinomo Sets*, *Kiddies Wear*, *Thrift Tops & Gowns (from \342\202\2462,000)*, and *Wholesale / Bulk*.\n\n### 3. Factual Transparency & Social Proof\n- **Google Business Rating**: Formatted to reflect **5.0 stars from 1 Google review** without exaggeration or simulated review counts.\n- **Store Location & Hours**: Grounded all contact and pickup info in the store\'s location at *Ibadan Garage Side, Ijebu Ode, 120101, Ogun State, Nigeria*, with notes on in-store visits and delivery across Nigeria.\n- **Sanitized Product Claims**: Cleaned all product and marketing descriptions, emphasizing careful hand-selection, washing, steam-ironing, and neat packaging.\n\n### 4. Direct WhatsApp Ordering & Reseller Desk\n- **Single-Item & Batch WhatsApp Inquiries**: Implemented structured, pre-filled WhatsApp message generation for single pieces and multi-item orders.\n- **Wholesale & Reseller Desk**: Configured the wholesale section with headline *\"Stock Your Store With Affordable Modest Fashion.\"*, structured inquiry form fields (*Name, Business Name, Phone Number, Products Interested In, Quantity Needed, Message*), and direct WhatsApp submission.\n\n### 5. SEO & Structured Data\n- **Schema.org Structured Data**: Configured valid `ClothingStore` JSON-LD schema with address coordinates for Ijebu Ode, Nigerian price ranges, and verified aggregate rating in `index.html`."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
