  user_input {
    user_response: "PREMIUM VISUAL DIRECTION \342\200\224 IMPORTANT\n\nI want you to significantly elevate the visual presentation of the existing Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears website.\n\nThe goal is for the finished website to visually feel like a premium \342\202\2461,000,000+ professional fashion-commerce website \342\200\224 not a typical small-business template and not an AI-generated storefront.\n\nDO NOT rebuild the entire project from scratch.\n\nKeep the existing functionality and architecture, but substantially improve the visual direction, art direction, spacing, typography, imagery, interaction design, and overall polish.\n\n==================================================\nFASHION PHOTOGRAPHY / PRODUCT PRESENTATION\n==================================================\n\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENT:\n\nDO NOT SHOW THE CLOTHING ON HUMAN MODELS.\n\nAll abayas, jalabiyas, kinomo sets, gowns, tops, and other garments should be presented on:\n\n- Elegant fashion mannequins\n- Minimalist dress forms\n- Professional clothing dummies\n- High-end retail display forms\n\nThe mannequin should feel like something from a premium fashion showroom.\n\nUse:\n- Full-body mannequins where appropriate\n- Torso mannequins for tops\n- Clean professional garment forms\n- Neutral matte mannequin finishes\n- Minimal visual distraction\n\nThe actual CLOTHING must remain the visual focus.\n\nDo not use:\n- Human faces\n- Human models\n- Lifestyle models\n- AI-generated people wearing the clothes\n- Busy backgrounds\n- Cheap-looking stock photography\n\n==================================================\nART DIRECTION\n==================================================\n\nThink:\n\nLUXURY MODEST FASHION EDITORIAL\n+\nPREMIUM NIGERIAN RETAIL\n+\nMODERN BOUTIQUE\n+\nEDITORIAL E-COMMERCE\n\nThe visual quality should resemble the level of a professionally commissioned fashion brand website.\n\nThe website should feel:\n\n- Expensive\n- Sophisticated\n- Editorial\n- Minimal\n- Confident\n- Elegant\n- Refined\n- Modern\n- Trustworthy\n- Commercial\n\nBut it must still communicate that Pearls Elegance offers ACCESSIBLE / AFFORDABLE fashion.\n\nDo not make the website look like an ultra-exclusive couture label.\n\n==================================================\nVISUAL STYLE\n==================================================\n\nUse the existing palette:\n\nWarm Ivory: #FAF8F5\nSoft Cream: #F5EFE6\nCharcoal: #1C1917\nMuted Gold: #C5A059\n\nUse these with restraint.\n\nMost of the interface should remain calm and neutral.\n\nGold should function as a subtle luxury accent for:\n- small labels\n- dividers\n- icons\n- active states\n- refined details\n\nDo NOT cover the entire website in gold.\n\n==================================================\nTYPOGRAPHY\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\nCormorant Garamond\nfor:\n- Hero headlines\n- Major editorial statements\n- Section titles\n- Fashion campaign messaging\n\nPlus Jakarta Sans\nfor:\n- Navigation\n- Product information\n- Buttons\n- Prices\n- Body copy\n- Filters\n- Forms\n\nTypography should have excellent hierarchy.\n\nLarge editorial headlines.\nGenerous line-height.\nStrong whitespace.\nShort, confident copy.\n\nAvoid oversized text that feels like a generic AI landing page.\n\n==================================================\nHOMEPAGE HERO\n==================================================\n\nCompletely refine the hero section.\n\nThe hero should look like an editorial fashion campaign.\n\nUse one exceptional mannequin/product composition instead of a collage of random images.\n\nThe garment should be:\n- beautifully lit\n- sharply photographed\n- centered with intentional composition\n- surrounded by generous negative space\n- presented against a warm neutral studio environment\n\nAdd a subtle editorial label such as:\n\nPEARLS ELEGANCE\nMODEST WEAR \342\200\242 IJEBU ODE\n\nMain headline:\n\n\342\200\234Elegance, Within Reach.\342\200\235\n\nSupporting text:\n\n\342\200\234Discover thoughtfully selected abayas, jalabiyas and modest wear for every occasion.\342\200\235\n\nPrimary CTA:\n\nSHOP NEW ARRIVALS\n\nSecondary CTA:\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nKeep:\n\nBased in Ijebu Ode, Ogun State \342\200\242 Serving customers across Nigeria\n\nonly where factually supported.\n\nThe hero must immediately communicate PREMIUM FASHION.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT IMAGERY\n==================================================\n\nEvery product card should feel like a product from a premium fashion catalog.\n\nDo not use generic square cards with random images.\n\nCreate a sophisticated editorial product grid.\n\nUse large imagery with:\n- Consistent aspect ratios\n- Clean backgrounds\n- Soft shadows where appropriate\n- High image quality\n- Generous spacing\n- Minimal borders\n- Elegant hover interactions\n\nProduct names and prices should remain visually understated.\n\nExample:\n\nTHRIFT ABAYA\n\342\202\2469,000\n\n[View Piece]\n\nAvoid excessive badges and UI clutter.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT DETAIL PAGE\n==================================================\n\nMake product pages feel like an actual fashion-commerce experience.\n\nLarge product photography should dominate the page.\n\nShow:\n- Main garment image\n- Additional views\n- Product name\n- Price\n- Availability\n- Product information\n- WhatsApp CTA\n\nUse sophisticated editorial spacing.\n\nExample:\n\nTHRIFT ABAYA\n\n\342\202\2469,000\n\nAvailable\n\nA carefully selected modest piece with a distinctive silhouette and elegant detailing.\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nAvoid large blocks of unnecessary text.\n\n==================================================\nNEW ARRIVALS\n==================================================\n\nTreat New Arrivals like a fashion editorial collection.\n\nSection heading:\n\nNEW ARRIVALS\n\nSmall supporting label:\n\nFRESHLY ADDED\n\nUse large mannequin photography.\n\nEach product should look intentionally photographed, not dumped into a catalog.\n\nCreate visual rhythm:\nlarge image\nsmall text\nlarge image\nsmall text\n\nKeep the layout breathable.\n\n==================================================\nCATEGORY PRESENTATION\n==================================================\n\nMake categories visually editorial.\n\nCategories:\n\nABAYAS\nJALABIYAS\nKINOMO\nKIDDIES WEAR\nTHRIFT TOPS & GOWNS\n\nInstead of generic icon cards, use beautiful garment imagery on mannequins.\n\nEach category should feel like an invitation into a collection.\n\n==================================================\nWHOLESALE\n==================================================\n\nThe wholesale section should still feel premium.\n\nDo NOT make it look like a wholesale warehouse website.\n\nHeadline:\n\n\342\200\234Build Your Collection.\342\200\235\n\nSupporting message:\n\n\342\200\234Looking to stock your boutique or online store? Explore wholesale and bulk purchasing options with Pearls Elegance.\342\200\235\n\nCTA:\n\nENQUIRE ABOUT WHOLESALE\n\nUse understated fashion imagery.\n\n==================================================\nCUSTOMER REVIEWS\n==================================================\n\nCreate a beautiful editorial testimonial section.\n\nThis section must use REAL reviews supplied by the business.\n\nDo not generate reviews.\n\nDo not label these as Google reviews unless they actually came from Google.\n\nSeparate them from the verified Google information:\n\n5.0\nGoogle Rating\n1 Review\n\nThen separately:\n\nWHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY\n\nUse elegant testimonial cards with lots of whitespace.\n\n==================================================\nSTORE / LOCATION\n==================================================\n\nDo not make the contact section look like a generic footer/contact block.\n\nMake it feel like a boutique location.\n\nShow:\n\nPEARLS ELEGANCE\nTHRIFT ABAYA WEARS\n\nIbadan Garage Side\nIjebu Ode, Ogun State\nNigeria\n\n0811 244 4087\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nVISIT US\n\nUse a refined map/location treatment.\n\n==================================================\nNAVIGATION\n==================================================\n\nDesktop navigation should be extremely clean.\n\nLogo on left.\n\nNavigation:\n\nShop\nNew Arrivals\nWholesale\nAbout\nContact\n\nWhatsApp CTA on right.\n\nAvoid oversized navigation bars.\n\nUse a refined sticky header with subtle background transition on scroll.\n\n==================================================\nANIMATION\n==================================================\n\nUse sophisticated micro-interactions.\n\nExamples:\n\n- Gentle image scale on hover\n- Smooth page transitions\n- Subtle reveal animations\n- Elegant button transitions\n- Product image crossfade\n- Navigation underline animation\n- Smooth inquiry drawer\n- Gentle header transformation on scroll\n\nAnimation should feel expensive and intentional.\n\nAbsolutely avoid:\n- bouncing elements\n- excessive motion\n- flashy effects\n- glowing elements\n- dramatic gradients\n- spinning objects\n- unnecessary parallax\n\n==================================================\nSPACING\n==================================================\n\nIncrease the amount of whitespace throughout the website.\n\nPremium websites often feel expensive because of:\n- spacing\n- typography\n- image quality\n- restraint\n- consistency\n\nDo not cram sections together.\n\nCreate clear visual breathing room between:\n- Hero\n- Collections\n- Products\n- Editorial sections\n- Reviews\n- Wholesale\n- Location\n- Footer\n\n==================================================\nMOBILE\n==================================================\n\nThe website remains MOBILE-FIRST.\n\nThe mobile version must feel just as premium as desktop.\n\nDo NOT simply stack desktop sections.\n\nDesign the mobile compositions intentionally.\n\nUse:\n- full-width editorial imagery\n- large product photography\n- elegant typography\n- clean sticky navigation\n- simple filters\n- persistent WhatsApp access\n\nThe sticky mobile bar should feel integrated into the brand, not like a generic app toolbar.\n\n==================================================\nIMAGE QUALITY\n==================================================\n\nEvery image should feel like it was professionally photographed.\n\nFor all product visuals:\n- Neutral studio backgrounds\n- Soft directional lighting\n- Clean garment presentation\n- Mannequin/dress-form presentation\n- Accurate garment colors\n- High resolution\n- Minimal distractions\n\nThe clothes must be the hero.\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT BRAND PRINCIPLE\n==================================================\n\nThis is NOT:\n\n\342\200\234a website for a thrift seller.\342\200\235\n\nIt should visually communicate:\n\n\342\200\234A modern modest-fashion brand that happens to offer affordable thrift pieces.\342\200\235\n\nThat distinction is extremely important.\n\nThe customer should immediately feel:\n\n\342\200\234This brand takes fashion seriously.\342\200\235\n\n==================================================\nFINAL QUALITY BAR\n==================================================\n\nBefore finishing, review every page as if the website were being presented to a client who paid \342\202\2461,000,000+ for the website.\n\nAsk:\n\nDoes this look professionally art-directed?\n\nDoes the typography feel premium?\n\nDo the clothes look desirable?\n\nDoes the photography feel consistent?\n\nDoes the spacing feel intentional?\n\nDoes the mobile version feel expensive?\n\nDoes anything look like an AI-generated template?\n\nDoes anything look cheap, generic, crowded, or unnecessary?\n\nRemove anything that lowers the perceived value.\n\nThe final result should look like a serious fashion-commerce website designed by a high-end digital agency.\n\nPreserve the existing functionality, product system, WhatsApp ordering, inquiry basket, SEO, and business information.\n\nUpgrade the EXPERIENCE and VISUAL QUALITY substantially."
    items {
      text: "PREMIUM VISUAL DIRECTION \342\200\224 IMPORTANT\n\nI want you to significantly elevate the visual presentation of the existing Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears website.\n\nThe goal is for the finished website to visually feel like a premium \342\202\2461,000,000+ professional fashion-commerce website \342\200\224 not a typical small-business template and not an AI-generated storefront.\n\nDO NOT rebuild the entire project from scratch.\n\nKeep the existing functionality and architecture, but substantially improve the visual direction, art direction, spacing, typography, imagery, interaction design, and overall polish.\n\n==================================================\nFASHION PHOTOGRAPHY / PRODUCT PRESENTATION\n==================================================\n\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENT:\n\nDO NOT SHOW THE CLOTHING ON HUMAN MODELS.\n\nAll abayas, jalabiyas, kinomo sets, gowns, tops, and other garments should be presented on:\n\n- Elegant fashion mannequins\n- Minimalist dress forms\n- Professional clothing dummies\n- High-end retail display forms\n\nThe mannequin should feel like something from a premium fashion showroom.\n\nUse:\n- Full-body mannequins where appropriate\n- Torso mannequins for tops\n- Clean professional garment forms\n- Neutral matte mannequin finishes\n- Minimal visual distraction\n\nThe actual CLOTHING must remain the visual focus.\n\nDo not use:\n- Human faces\n- Human models\n- Lifestyle models\n- AI-generated people wearing the clothes\n- Busy backgrounds\n- Cheap-looking stock photography\n\n==================================================\nART DIRECTION\n==================================================\n\nThink:\n\nLUXURY MODEST FASHION EDITORIAL\n+\nPREMIUM NIGERIAN RETAIL\n+\nMODERN BOUTIQUE\n+\nEDITORIAL E-COMMERCE\n\nThe visual quality should resemble the level of a professionally commissioned fashion brand website.\n\nThe website should feel:\n\n- Expensive\n- Sophisticated\n- Editorial\n- Minimal\n- Confident\n- Elegant\n- Refined\n- Modern\n- Trustworthy\n- Commercial\n\nBut it must still communicate that Pearls Elegance offers ACCESSIBLE / AFFORDABLE fashion.\n\nDo not make the website look like an ultra-exclusive couture label.\n\n==================================================\nVISUAL STYLE\n==================================================\n\nUse the existing palette:\n\nWarm Ivory: #FAF8F5\nSoft Cream: #F5EFE6\nCharcoal: #1C1917\nMuted Gold: #C5A059\n\nUse these with restraint.\n\nMost of the interface should remain calm and neutral.\n\nGold should function as a subtle luxury accent for:\n- small labels\n- dividers\n- icons\n- active states\n- refined details\n\nDo NOT cover the entire website in gold.\n\n==================================================\nTYPOGRAPHY\n==================================================\n\nUse:\n\nCormorant Garamond\nfor:\n- Hero headlines\n- Major editorial statements\n- Section titles\n- Fashion campaign messaging\n\nPlus Jakarta Sans\nfor:\n- Navigation\n- Product information\n- Buttons\n- Prices\n- Body copy\n- Filters\n- Forms\n\nTypography should have excellent hierarchy.\n\nLarge editorial headlines.\nGenerous line-height.\nStrong whitespace.\nShort, confident copy.\n\nAvoid oversized text that feels like a generic AI landing page.\n\n==================================================\nHOMEPAGE HERO\n==================================================\n\nCompletely refine the hero section.\n\nThe hero should look like an editorial fashion campaign.\n\nUse one exceptional mannequin/product composition instead of a collage of random images.\n\nThe garment should be:\n- beautifully lit\n- sharply photographed\n- centered with intentional composition\n- surrounded by generous negative space\n- presented against a warm neutral studio environment\n\nAdd a subtle editorial label such as:\n\nPEARLS ELEGANCE\nMODEST WEAR \342\200\242 IJEBU ODE\n\nMain headline:\n\n\342\200\234Elegance, Within Reach.\342\200\235\n\nSupporting text:\n\n\342\200\234Discover thoughtfully selected abayas, jalabiyas and modest wear for every occasion.\342\200\235\n\nPrimary CTA:\n\nSHOP NEW ARRIVALS\n\nSecondary CTA:\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nKeep:\n\nBased in Ijebu Ode, Ogun State \342\200\242 Serving customers across Nigeria\n\nonly where factually supported.\n\nThe hero must immediately communicate PREMIUM FASHION.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT IMAGERY\n==================================================\n\nEvery product card should feel like a product from a premium fashion catalog.\n\nDo not use generic square cards with random images.\n\nCreate a sophisticated editorial product grid.\n\nUse large imagery with:\n- Consistent aspect ratios\n- Clean backgrounds\n- Soft shadows where appropriate\n- High image quality\n- Generous spacing\n- Minimal borders\n- Elegant hover interactions\n\nProduct names and prices should remain visually understated.\n\nExample:\n\nTHRIFT ABAYA\n\342\202\2469,000\n\n[View Piece]\n\nAvoid excessive badges and UI clutter.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT DETAIL PAGE\n==================================================\n\nMake product pages feel like an actual fashion-commerce experience.\n\nLarge product photography should dominate the page.\n\nShow:\n- Main garment image\n- Additional views\n- Product name\n- Price\n- Availability\n- Product information\n- WhatsApp CTA\n\nUse sophisticated editorial spacing.\n\nExample:\n\nTHRIFT ABAYA\n\n\342\202\2469,000\n\nAvailable\n\nA carefully selected modest piece with a distinctive silhouette and elegant detailing.\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nAvoid large blocks of unnecessary text.\n\n==================================================\nNEW ARRIVALS\n==================================================\n\nTreat New Arrivals like a fashion editorial collection.\n\nSection heading:\n\nNEW ARRIVALS\n\nSmall supporting label:\n\nFRESHLY ADDED\n\nUse large mannequin photography.\n\nEach product should