    thinking: "**Focusing on Abaya Photography**\n\nI\'m zeroing in on the core challenge: capturing high-fashion aesthetics for abayas, jalabiyas, and kimonos *without* using human models. The goal is to elevate the visual presentation of these garments using mannequins, ensuring the photography is editorial and aligns precisely with the user\'s explicit instructions. My focus will be on composition, lighting, and styling the mannequins.\n\n\n**Defining Mannequin Requirements**\n\nI\'m now narrowing down the specifics of the mannequins and forms. They must exude premium fashion showroom quality. I\'m prioritizing neutral matte finishes to ensure the garments remain the central focus, and I\'m detailing the essential use of full-body versus torso mannequins. The aim is to avoid any visual distractions. I\'m focusing on \"clean professional garment forms\" to achieve the intended effect. I\'m also ensuring that human elements, AI-generated figures, busy backgrounds and typical stock photography are explicitly off-limits. I\'m focused on hero shots with precise instructions, and plan to execute with `generate_image`. I\'m starting with a hero image: `hero_mannequin_abaya` to showcase an abaya.\n\n\n"
