    thinking: "**Analyzing Requirements**\n\nI\'m diving into the user\'s detailed requirements. I\'ve focused my attention on the HERO SECTION specifically. It\'s an editorial fashion campaign look, centered on a single, striking mannequin and product display. There\'s a subtle editorial label needed: \"PEARLS ELEGANCE\".\n\n\n**Defining the Narrative**\n\nI\'ve crafted the core messaging now: \"Elegance, Within Reach.\" with supporting text, CTAs, and location details for the HERO section. I\'m focusing on \"SHOP NEW ARRIVALS\" as the primary call to action, and the \"PEARLS ELEGANCE\" label. I also have the category section next, which will use mannequin images. The categories will include abayas, jalabiyas, and kinomo. I\'m working on the new arrivals section, to be visually appealing.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Elements**\n\nI\'m now iterating on the product card and detail modal designs. My focus is on large, consistent imagery with a clean aesthetic and understated typography. I want to convey elegance and ease of use in the product display. I\'m also conceptualizing the wholesale section with high-fashion visuals to convey a clean, editorial look. Customer reviews and social proof will be next.\n\n\n"
