    response: "I have completed the visual and editorial refinement for **Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears**, elevating the storefront into an editorial modest-fashion experience:\n\n- **Editorial Fashion Campaign Hero**: Transformed the hero section using a high-resolution mannequin composition framed with generous negative space, refined serif display typography (*Cormorant Garamond* paired with *Plus Jakarta Sans*), clear micro-labels (`Pearls Elegance \342\200\242 Modest Wear \342\200\242 Ijebu Ode`), the primary tagline (*\342\200\234Elegance, Within Reach.\342\200\235*), and dedicated primary actions for browsing new arrivals or initiating direct WhatsApp inquiries.\n- **Mannequin Category Showcase**: Replaced basic icons with editorial mannequin imagery across all core collections (Abayas, Jalabiyas, Kinomo Sets, Kiddies Wear, Tops & Gowns, and Wholesale), complete with price indicators and smooth hover interactions.\n- **Curated New Arrivals & Catalog Layouts**: Refined product cards with unified 3:4 aspect ratio mannequin photography, crisp Naira pricing (\342\202\2462,000\342\200\223\342\202\24615,000), single-click WhatsApp order shortcuts, and multi-item inquiry drawer integration.\n- **B2B Wholesale Portal Styling**: Re-architected the wholesale module (*\342\200\234Build Your Collection\342\200\235*) into a boutique reseller desk with batch requirement selectors and direct WhatsApp forwarding.\n- **Customer Experience & Verified Trust**: Integrated an editorial customer review section alongside the verified Google rating badge (5.0 stars from 1 review) and a physical store directory card for the Ibadan Garage Side location in Ijebu Ode."
