  user_input {
    user_response: "I have completed the current visual refinement for Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears.\n\nNow make one final professional polish pass across the entire website.\n\nIMPORTANT CHANGE:\nREMOVE THE GOOGLE REVIEW / GOOGLE RATING ENTIRELY FROM THE WEBSITE.\n\nDo not display:\n- 5.0 Google rating\n- 1 Google review\n- Google review badges\n- Google logos\n- Any wording suggesting the displayed testimonials are Google reviews\n\nInstead, the website should rely on the brand presentation, real customer testimonials provided by the business, product quality, photography, location, and WhatsApp ordering experience for trust.\n\n==================================================\nFINAL CREATIVE DIRECTION\n==================================================\n\nThe website should feel like a premium fashion-commerce experience that could realistically have been commissioned for a high-end Nigerian fashion brand.\n\nThe perceived quality should be extremely high.\n\nThink:\n\nEDITORIAL FASHION\n+\nPREMIUM BOUTIQUE\n+\nMODERN E-COMMERCE\n+\nMODEST LUXURY\n\nIt should look like a serious professional agency built it, not an AI-generated template.\n\nDo NOT completely redesign the website from scratch.\n\nPreserve the existing functionality and architecture.\n\nInstead, refine the details that determine perceived quality:\n- spacing\n- typography\n- composition\n- imagery\n- hierarchy\n- interaction design\n- consistency\n- responsiveness\n- content presentation\n- visual restraint\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT PRESENTATION\n==================================================\n\nKeep the mannequin/dress-form direction.\n\nDO NOT show human models.\n\nAll clothing should be presented on:\n- elegant mannequins\n- professional dress forms\n- premium retail displays\n\nThe garments must remain the focal point.\n\nProduct imagery should feel:\n- professionally photographed\n- clean\n- editorial\n- consistent\n- realistic\n- premium\n\nAvoid:\n- random stock photography\n- human models\n- faces\n- busy lifestyle scenes\n- inconsistent backgrounds\n- cheap-looking product images\n\nUse consistent lighting, framing, scale, and image ratios across the catalog.\n\n==================================================\nBRAND VISUAL SYSTEM\n==================================================\n\nContinue using:\n\nWarm Ivory #FAF8F5\nSoft Cream #F5EFE6\nCharcoal #1C1917\nMuted Gold #C5A059\n\nUse the gold very selectively.\n\nTypography:\n\nCormorant Garamond\nfor:\n- hero headlines\n- major editorial headings\n- collection titles\n\nPlus Jakarta Sans\nfor:\n- navigation\n- descriptions\n- product information\n- prices\n- buttons\n- filters\n- forms\n\nCreate a strong typographic hierarchy.\n\n==================================================\nHERO\n==================================================\n\nKeep the editorial mannequin hero.\n\nRefine it so it feels like a luxury fashion campaign rather than a standard website hero.\n\nUse:\n\nPEARLS ELEGANCE\nMODEST WEAR \342\200\242 IJEBU ODE\n\nHeadline:\n\n\342\200\234Elegance, Within Reach.\342\200\235\n\nSupporting copy:\n\n\342\200\234Discover affordable thrift abayas, jalabiyas and modest wear, carefully selected for everyday elegance.\342\200\235\n\nPrimary CTA:\nSHOP NEW ARRIVALS\n\nSecondary CTA:\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nKeep the composition spacious and visually balanced.\n\n==================================================\nCATEGORY SECTION\n==================================================\n\nKeep the mannequin-based collection presentation.\n\nCategories:\n\nAbayas\nJalabiyas\nKinomo\nKiddies Wear\nThrift Tops & Gowns\nWholesale\n\nMake each collection feel editorial.\n\nUse strong photography, elegant labels, subtle hover movement, and generous whitespace.\n\nDo not overcrowd the cards with unnecessary information.\n\n==================================================\nNEW ARRIVALS\n==================================================\n\nMake this one of the strongest sections on the homepage.\n\nHeading:\n\nNEW ARRIVALS\n\nSmall label:\n\nFRESHLY ADDED\n\nUse large, beautifully framed mannequin product imagery.\n\nMake the layout feel more like a fashion lookbook than a generic product grid.\n\nMaintain real prices only.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT CARDS\n==================================================\n\nRefine every product card.\n\nPrioritize:\n1. Photography\n2. Product name\n3. Price\n4. Availability\n5. WhatsApp action\n\nKeep the UI minimal.\n\nUse restrained borders, shadows, and badges.\n\nAvoid excessive buttons.\n\nUse refined hover interactions.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT DETAIL\n==================================================\n\nMake individual product pages feel premium and editorial.\n\nUse:\n- large imagery\n- multiple views where available\n- clear product title\n- price\n- availability\n- short description\n- product information\n- WhatsApp order action\n\nThe product photography should occupy most of the visual attention.\n\n==================================================\nCUSTOMER TESTIMONIALS\n==================================================\n\nKeep the customer testimonial section, but make it more sophisticated.\n\nDo NOT call these:\n- Google Reviews\n- Google Testimonials\n- Google Rating\n\nUse:\n\nWHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY\n\nOnly use genuine customer reviews/testimonials that have actually been provided by the business.\n\nDo not generate fake testimonials.\n\nUse elegant typography and generous whitespace.\n\nThe testimonial section should feel editorial and trustworthy without relying on a rating badge.\n\n==================================================\nWHOLESALE\n==================================================\n\nKeep the \342\200\234Build Your Collection\342\200\235 section.\n\nMake it feel like a premium B2B fashion service rather than a generic wholesale form.\n\nTarget:\n- boutique owners\n- resellers\n- online fashion vendors\n- bulk buyers\n\nCTA:\n\nENQUIRE ABOUT WHOLESALE\n\nKeep the direct WhatsApp flow.\n\nDo not invent:\n- minimum quantities\n- bale sizes\n- discounts\n- delivery guarantees\n- shipping methods\n- wholesale prices\n\nunless already provided as real business information.\n\n==================================================\nLOCATION / CONTACT\n==================================================\n\nKeep the physical store information prominent.\n\nPearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears\n\nIbadan Garage Side\nIjebu Ode\n120101\nOgun State\nNigeria\n\n0811 244 4087\n\nUse:\nCALL\nWHATSAPP\nDIRECTIONS\n\nMake the location section visually refined and boutique-like.\n\nDo not show unverified opening hours.\n\n==================================================\nREMOVE GOOGLE COMPLETELY\n==================================================\n\nSearch the entire codebase and remove all references to:\n- Google rating\n- Google reviews\n- Google Review\n- 5.0 rating\n- 1 review\n- Google badge\n- Google review icon\n- Google trust badge\n\nAlso remove any unnecessary components, imports, variables, or sections that only existed for the Google review display.\n\nDo not leave empty gaps where the section was removed.\n\nRebalance the page spacing after removing it.\n\n==================================================\nPREMIUM DETAILS\n==================================================\n\nImprove subtle details throughout the site:\n\n- elegant section dividers\n- refined hover states\n- better button transitions\n- subtle image zoom\n- smooth drawer transitions\n- polished navigation\n- consistent corner radii\n- carefully controlled shadows\n- premium spacing\n- balanced whitespace\n- consistent icon sizing\n- refined mobile controls\n\nDo not over-animate.\n\nThe website should feel calm and expensive.\n\n==================================================\nMOBILE QUALITY\n==================================================\n\nPay special attention to mobile.\n\nCheck approximately:\n320px\n375px\n390px\n430px\n\nMake sure:\n- no horizontal overflow\n- no clipped text\n- no overlapping buttons\n- sticky elements do not cover content\n- images remain beautiful\n- product cards remain readable\n- WhatsApp actions are easy to access\n- navigation feels intentional\n- inquiry basket works perfectly\n\n==================================================\nFINAL ART DIRECTION TEST\n==================================================\n\nBefore completing the task, inspect the entire website as a senior fashion e-commerce art director.\n\nRemove anything that feels:\n- generic\n- cheap\n- crowded\n- overly animated\n- overly technical\n- inconsistent\n- AI-generated\n- unnecessary\n\nStrengthen anything that improves:\n- perceived value\n- trust\n- elegance\n- product desirability\n- clarity\n- conversion\n\nThe final result should feel like:\n\n\342\200\234A premium Nigerian modest-fashion brand with a carefully art-directed digital storefront.\342\200\235\n\nIt should be visually strong enough that a client would immediately understand why the website represents a serious professional web-development project.\n\nMake the final result polished, restrained, luxurious, commercial, and authentic."
