  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the final professional polish and production-readiness pass for **Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears**:\n\n- **Complete Google Review Removal**: Eliminated all mentions of Google ratings, 5.0 badges, review counts, and associated logos across every view, footer, metadata, and structured data schemas. Trust is now driven by brand presentation, fabric care guarantees, direct WhatsApp consultation, and authentic customer testimonials.\n- **Editorial Fashion & Boutique Direction**: Refined the visual hierarchy with **Cormorant Garamond** for editorial headlines and **Plus Jakarta Sans** for navigation and commerce copy, set against a warm neutral canvas (`#FAF8F5`) with muted gold (`#C5A059`) and deep charcoal (`#1C1917`) accents.\n- **Strict Mannequin & Dress-Form Presentation**: Garments are showcased exclusively on minimalist fashion dress forms, tailoring mannequins, and retail display stands.\n- **Responsive Mobile & Commerce UX**: Polished interactive states across all breakpoints (320px\342\200\223430px+), including the sticky mobile action bar, real-time inquiry drawer, category filtering, and direct WhatsApp ordering links."
    modified_response: "I have completed the final professional polish and production-readiness pass for **Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears**:\n\n- **Complete Google Review Removal**: Eliminated all mentions of Google ratings, 5.0 badges, review counts, and associated logos across every view, footer, metadata, and structured data schemas. Trust is now driven by brand presentation, fabric care guarantees, direct WhatsApp consultation, and authentic customer testimonials.\n- **Editorial Fashion & Boutique Direction**: Refined the visual hierarchy with **Cormorant Garamond** for editorial headlines and **Plus Jakarta Sans** for navigation and commerce copy, set against a warm neutral canvas (`#FAF8F5`) with muted gold (`#C5A059`) and deep charcoal (`#1C1917`) accents.\n- **Strict Mannequin & Dress-Form Presentation**: Garments are showcased exclusively on minimalist fashion dress forms, tailoring mannequins, and retail display stands.\n- **Responsive Mobile & Commerce UX**: Polished interactive states across all breakpoints (320px\342\200\223430px+), including the sticky mobile action bar, real-time inquiry drawer, category filtering, and direct WhatsApp ordering links."
