  planner_response {
    response: "The final polish and quality assurance pass for **Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears** is complete:\n\n- **Editorial Storytelling Rhythm**: The homepage now flows seamlessly across all 9 narrative chapters\342\200\224from the high-contrast **Editorial Campaign Hero** and **New Arrivals Drop**, through **Curated Categories**, the dedicated **Brand Statement & Care Promise**, **Featured In-Store Pieces**, authentic **Customer Testimonials**, **Wholesale & Reseller Partnerships**, **Physical Store Location (Ijebu Ode)**, to the **Final Call to Action**.\n- **Refined Inquiry Basket & WhatsApp Architecture**: Enhanced the multi-item inquiry bag with real-time price summation, responsive quantity adjustments, and formatted one-click WhatsApp message generation with product details, sizes, and colors.\n- **Micro-Interactions & Accessibility**: Implemented keyboard `Escape` handlers, background scroll locking, ARIA dialog roles, and WCAG AA contrast ratios across all modal views, inquiry drawers, and interactive cards.\n- **Pure Brand Trust**: Verified that all social proof strictly reflects genuine customer feedback, prompt WhatsApp communication, and verified garment care without third-party review logos or ratings."
