    user_response: "BRAND / AGENCY CREDIT \342\200\224 IMPORTANT\n\nThis website is a professional client project designed and engineered by:\n\nNAMACO TECHNOLOGY NIGERIA LIMITED\n\nAdd the agency credit subtly and professionally throughout the website.\n\nUse the exact wording:\n\n\342\200\234Designed & Engineered by Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited\342\200\235\n\nPreferred placement:\n- Footer, prominently but elegantly\n- Optionally on the About / project section if appropriate\n- Do not place a large agency banner anywhere\n- Do not allow the credit to compete with the Pearls Elegance brand\n\nThe footer should feel premium and intentional.\n\nExample:\n\n\302\251 2026 Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears  \nDesigned & Engineered by Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited\n\nMake \342\200\234Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited\342\200\235 clickable only if a real company URL/social URL is available in the existing project. Do not invent a URL.\n\nKeep the credit typography understated and consistent with the overall editorial fashion aesthetic.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nPearls Elegance remains the primary brand throughout the website.\nNamaco Technology Nigeria Limited should be presented as the professional design and engineering studio behind the website, not as a second competing brand."
