  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Design Placement**\n\nI\'m currently focused on incorporating the user\'s specific wording, \"Designed & Engineered by Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited,\" into the design. I\'m prioritizing its placement in the footer, aiming for a prominent yet elegant presentation. I\'m also exploring optional placements.\n\n\n**Refining Footer Integration**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on integrating the \"Designed & Engineered\" credit within the footer, ensuring it feels premium and doesn\'t clash with the Pearls Elegance brand. I\'m focusing on elegant typography, subtle styling, and will only include a clickable link if a legitimate URL is available, which is not in this instance, so it remains cleanly rendered. The \"About/Project\" section will be revisited for potential credit placement.\n\n\n**Finalizing Digital Integration**\n\nI\'ve decided on the placement for the \"Designed & Engineered\" credit. I\'ve placed it in the footer, right where I anticipated, following the copyright notice. The styling prioritizes subtlety, with the company name subtly emphasized. I\'ve also incorporated the location details for the company\'s information. Now I\'m checking the `AboutView.tsx` file for a possible credit note placement.\n\n\n"
