  planner_response {
    response: "The top announcement strip has been removed and the header refined across all breakpoints:\n\n- **Clean Editorial Header**: The site opens with the **Pearls Elegance** wordmark and *\"THRIFT ABAYA WEARS\"* sub-label on an ivory backdrop, followed by navigation, search, and inquiry controls.\n- **Removed Announcement Elements**: Removed the top ticker bar, promotional strips, and unused icons/styles to eliminate visual noise and reclaim viewport space.\n- **Balanced Hero Transition**: Calibrated top padding and negative space so the homepage hero flows naturally beneath the navigation across mobile (320px\342\200\223430px) and desktop (768px\342\200\2231440px) viewports."
    modified_response: "The top announcement strip has been removed and the header refined across all breakpoints:\n\n- **Clean Editorial Header**: The site opens with the **Pearls Elegance** wordmark and *\"THRIFT ABAYA WEARS\"* sub-label on an ivory backdrop, followed by navigation, search, and inquiry controls.\n- **Removed Announcement Elements**: Removed the top ticker bar, promotional strips, and unused icons/styles to eliminate visual noise and reclaim viewport space.\n- **Balanced Hero Transition**: Calibrated top padding and negative space so the homepage hero flows naturally beneath the navigation across mobile (320px\342\200\223430px) and desktop (768px\342\200\2231440px) viewports."
