    items {
      text: "Remove the announcement bar completely from the Pearls Elegance website.\n\nRemove all remaining UI components, logic, styling, animations, data, and imports associated with the announcement bar containing:\n\n\342\200\234Washed, ironed & neatly packed thrift abayas \342\200\242 Delivering across Nigeria\342\200\235\n\nDo not replace it with another announcement bar, ticker, banner, or promotional strip.\n\nAfter removal:\n- Keep the navigation header clean, minimal, and premium.\n- Maintain generous but balanced whitespace.\n- Make sure the logo, search, inquiry/bag icon, and mobile menu remain correctly aligned.\n- Ensure the header works cleanly across mobile, tablet, and desktop.\n- Verify that there is NO empty space, margin, padding, or layout gap left behind by the removed component.\n- Rebalance the spacing between the header and hero section where necessary.\n- Do not change unrelated sections or functionality.\n\nTest responsive layouts at:\n320px, 375px, 390px, 430px, 768px, 1024px, 1280px, and 1440px.\n\nThe final header should feel intentional, spacious, refined, and premium."
    }
