  planner_response {
    response: "The top announcement bar and all associated code, styling, and logic have been removed:\n\n- **Clean Editorial Header**: The page opens with the **Pearls Elegance** wordmark and *\"THRIFT ABAYA WEARS\"* subtitle on a soft ivory background, immediately framing the desktop and mobile navigation controls.\n- **Zero Artifacts & Seamless Flow**: Purged all ticker elements, secondary banners, and promotional strips without leaving layout gaps or unnecessary padding above the hero and catalog views.\n- **Precision Alignment & Responsiveness**: Verified touch targets, search actions, inquiry bag counter badges, and mobile drawer transitions across all key breakpoints (320px, 375px, 390px, 430px, 768px, 1024px, 1280px, 1440px)."
    modified_response: "The top announcement bar and all associated code, styling, and logic have been removed:\n\n- **Clean Editorial Header**: The page opens with the **Pearls Elegance** wordmark and *\"THRIFT ABAYA WEARS\"* subtitle on a soft ivory background, immediately framing the desktop and mobile navigation controls.\n- **Zero Artifacts & Seamless Flow**: Purged all ticker elements, secondary banners, and promotional strips without leaving layout gaps or unnecessary padding above the hero and catalog views.\n- **Precision Alignment & Responsiveness**: Verified touch targets, search actions, inquiry bag counter badges, and mobile drawer transitions across all key breakpoints (320px, 375px, 390px, 430px, 768px, 1024px, 1280px, 1440px)."
