  user_input {
    user_response: "WHATSAPP PRODUCT ORDERING \342\200\224 FINAL REFINEMENT\n\nUpdate the shopping / WhatsApp ordering experience so that every individual product has a direct, product-specific WhatsApp order action.\n\nWhen a customer opens ANY product and clicks:\n\n\342\200\234ORDER ON WHATSAPP\342\200\235\n\nthe WhatsApp message must automatically start with the exact product the customer is viewing.\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in the Thrift Abaya priced at \342\202\2469,000.\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT-SPECIFIC BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nThe product name and price must come dynamically from the selected product data.\n\nFor example:\n\nProduct:\nThrift Abaya Wears\n\nPrice:\n\342\202\2469,000\n\nGenerated WhatsApp message:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in the Thrift Abaya Wears priced at \342\202\2469,000.\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\nDo NOT use a generic message such as:\n\n\342\200\234Hello, I\342\200\231m interested in your products.\342\200\235\n\nThe selected product must always be identifiable.\n\n==================================================\nSHOP PAGE\n==================================================\n\nOn every product card, provide a clear action:\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nWhen clicked, immediately open WhatsApp with that specific product included in the message.\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in:\nThrift Tops and Gowns \342\200\224 \342\202\2462,000\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT DETAIL PAGE\n==================================================\n\nThe product detail page should have the main CTA:\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nThe generated message must contain:\n\n- Product name\n- Current price\n- Optional selected variant/size if available\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in:\nKiddies Abaya and Jalabia \342\200\224 \342\202\2466,000\n\nSize: [selected size]\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nINQUIRY BASKET\n==================================================\n\nKeep the existing multi-product inquiry basket.\n\nThere should be TWO distinct flows:\n\n1. Single Product Order\nUser is viewing one product\n\342\206\222 clicks ORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\342\206\222 WhatsApp opens with ONLY that product\n\n2. Multiple Product Inquiry\nUser adds multiple products to the Inquiry Basket\n\342\206\222 opens Inquiry Basket\n\342\206\222 clicks SEND INQUIRY ON WHATSAPP\n\342\206\222 WhatsApp opens with ALL selected products listed\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in the following items:\n\n1. Thrift Abaya Wears \342\200\224 \342\202\2469,000\n2. Adult Jalabia \342\200\224 \342\202\2466,000\n3. Thrift Tops and Gowns \342\200\224 \342\202\2462,000\n\nPlease let me know which items are currently available.\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT UX RULE\n==================================================\n\nClicking \342\200\234ORDER ON WHATSAPP\342\200\235 on a product must NOT add unnecessary steps.\n\nThe expected flow is:\n\nPRODUCT\n\342\206\222 ORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\342\206\222 WHATSAPP\n\nFor the inquiry basket:\n\nPRODUCT\n\342\206\222 ADD TO INQUIRY\n\342\206\222 INQUIRY BASKET\n\342\206\222 SEND ON WHATSAPP\n\n==================================================\nIMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n==================================================\n\nUse the existing product data as the single source of truth.\n\nThe WhatsApp message should be generated dynamically from the product object rather than manually hardcoded for individual products.\n\nURL-encode the message correctly before opening WhatsApp.\n\nUse the existing WhatsApp number:\n\n2348112444087\n\nWhatsApp URL format:\n\nhttps://wa.me/2348112444087?text=[ENCODED_MESSAGE]\n\nMake sure:\n- Product names are correctly encoded\n- \342\202\246 prices are preserved correctly\n- line breaks work correctly\n- special characters do not break the URL\n- the link works on mobile\n- the link works on desktop\n- no stale product information is used\n\n==================================================\nFINAL QA\n==================================================\n\nTest the WhatsApp action on several different products.\n\nVerify that when Product A is clicked, WhatsApp says Product A.\n\nWhen Product B is clicked, WhatsApp says Product B.\n\nWhen multiple products are selected, all selected products appear in the inquiry.\n\nDo not change unrelated functionality.\n\nMake this feel like a polished commerce experience rather than a generic contact button."
    items {
      text: "WHATSAPP PRODUCT ORDERING \342\200\224 FINAL REFINEMENT\n\nUpdate the shopping / WhatsApp ordering experience so that every individual product has a direct, product-specific WhatsApp order action.\n\nWhen a customer opens ANY product and clicks:\n\n\342\200\234ORDER ON WHATSAPP\342\200\235\n\nthe WhatsApp message must automatically start with the exact product the customer is viewing.\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in the Thrift Abaya priced at \342\202\2469,000.\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT-SPECIFIC BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nThe product name and price must come dynamically from the selected product data.\n\nFor example:\n\nProduct:\nThrift Abaya Wears\n\nPrice:\n\342\202\2469,000\n\nGenerated WhatsApp message:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in the Thrift Abaya Wears priced at \342\202\2469,000.\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\nDo NOT use a generic message such as:\n\n\342\200\234Hello, I\342\200\231m interested in your products.\342\200\235\n\nThe selected product must always be identifiable.\n\n==================================================\nSHOP PAGE\n==================================================\n\nOn every product card, provide a clear action:\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nWhen clicked, immediately open WhatsApp with that specific product included in the message.\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in:\nThrift Tops and Gowns \342\200\224 \342\202\2462,000\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nPRODUCT DETAIL PAGE\n==================================================\n\nThe product detail page should have the main CTA:\n\nORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\nThe generated message must contain:\n\n- Product name\n- Current price\n- Optional selected variant/size if available\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in:\nKiddies Abaya and Jalabia \342\200\224 \342\202\2466,000\n\nSize: [selected size]\n\nIs this item still available?\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nINQUIRY BASKET\n==================================================\n\nKeep the existing multi-product inquiry basket.\n\nThere should be TWO distinct flows:\n\n1. Single Product Order\nUser is viewing one product\n\342\206\222 clicks ORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\342\206\222 WhatsApp opens with ONLY that product\n\n2. Multiple Product Inquiry\nUser adds multiple products to the Inquiry Basket\n\342\206\222 opens Inquiry Basket\n\342\206\222 clicks SEND INQUIRY ON WHATSAPP\n\342\206\222 WhatsApp opens with ALL selected products listed\n\nExample:\n\nHello Pearls Elegance,\n\nI\342\200\231m interested in the following items:\n\n1. Thrift Abaya Wears \342\200\224 \342\202\2469,000\n2. Adult Jalabia \342\200\224 \342\202\2466,000\n3. Thrift Tops and Gowns \342\200\224 \342\202\2462,000\n\nPlease let me know which items are currently available.\n\nThank you.\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT UX RULE\n==================================================\n\nClicking \342\200\234ORDER ON WHATSAPP\342\200\235 on a product must NOT add unnecessary steps.\n\nThe expected flow is:\n\nPRODUCT\n\342\206\222 ORDER ON WHATSAPP\n\342\206\222 WHATSAPP\n\nFor the inquiry basket:\n\nPRODUCT\n\342\206\222 ADD TO INQUIRY\n\342\206\222 INQUIRY BASKET\n\342\206\222 SEND ON WHATSAPP\n\n==================================================\nIMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n==================================================\n\nUse the existing product data as the single source of truth.\n\nThe WhatsApp message should be generated dynamically from the product object rather than manually hardcoded for individual products.\n\nURL-encode the message correctly before opening WhatsApp.\n\nUse the existing WhatsApp number:\n\n2348112444087\n\nWhatsApp URL format:\n\nhttps://wa.me/2348112444087?text=[ENCODED_MESSAGE]\n\nMake sure:\n- Product names are correctly encoded\n- \342\202\246 prices are preserved correctly\n- line breaks work correctly\n- special characters do not break the URL\n- the link works on mobile\n- the link works on desktop\n- no stale product information is used\n\n==================================================\nFINAL QA\n==================================================\n\nTest the WhatsApp action on several different products.\n\nVerify that when Product A is clicked, WhatsApp says Product A.\n\nWhen Product B is clicked, WhatsApp says Product B.\n\nWhen multiple products are selected, all selected products appear in the inquiry.\n\nDo not change unrelated functionality.\n\nMake this feel like a polished commerce experience rather than a generic contact button."
    }
  }
}
