  user_input {
    user_response: "FINAL FOOTER REFINEMENT\n\nRefine the footer of the Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears website so it feels exceptionally polished, premium, and professionally engineered.\n\nREMOVE the current bullet/separator-heavy presentation.\n\nUse this exact content:\n\n\302\251 2026 Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears. All rights reserved.\n\nDesigned & Engineered by Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited.\n\nIjebu Ode, Ogun State, Nigeria\n\n==================================================\nDESIGN DIRECTION\n==================================================\n\nMake the footer feel like the closing frame of a premium fashion website.\n\nUse:\n- generous vertical spacing\n- refined typography\n- subtle hierarchy\n- clean alignment\n- restrained borders/dividers\n- warm neutral background\n- excellent mobile spacing\n\nThe primary brand information should remain:\n\nPearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears\n\nThe agency credit should be secondary but clearly visible:\n\nDesigned & Engineered by Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited.\n\nDo not make the agency credit look like an advertisement.\n\nDo not use:\n- bullet separators\n- excessive icons\n- oversized text\n- unnecessary badges\n- excessive borders\n- large empty areas\n- decorative clutter\n\n==================================================\nTYPOGRAPHY\n==================================================\n\nUse the existing brand typography system:\n\nCormorant Garamond:\n- only where appropriate for brand/editorial elements\n\nPlus Jakarta Sans:\n- copyright\n- agency credit\n- location\n- footer navigation/information\n\nThe footer text should be understated and elegant.\n\n==================================================\nRESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nOn desktop:\n- Keep the footer spacious and balanced.\n- Align content precisely with the main site container.\n\nOn mobile:\n- Stack the information naturally.\n- Center-align where appropriate.\n- Prevent awkward wrapping.\n- Make sure the agency credit remains readable.\n- No horizontal overflow.\n\nTest at:\n320px\n375px\n390px\n430px\n768px\n1024px\n1280px\n1440px\n\n==================================================\nFINAL DETAIL\n==================================================\n\nThe footer should feel intentional and complete \342\200\224 like the final detail of a website designed by a professional digital studio.\n\nDo not redesign unrelated sections.\nOnly refine the footer and its responsive behavior.\n\nMake the final footer feel:\nquiet\nconfident\npremium\nminimal\nfinished"
    items {
      text: "FINAL FOOTER REFINEMENT\n\nRefine the footer of the Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears website so it feels exceptionally polished, premium, and professionally engineered.\n\nREMOVE the current bullet/separator-heavy presentation.\n\nUse this exact content:\n\n\302\251 2026 Pearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears. All rights reserved.\n\nDesigned & Engineered by Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited.\n\nIjebu Ode, Ogun State, Nigeria\n\n==================================================\nDESIGN DIRECTION\n==================================================\n\nMake the footer feel like the closing frame of a premium fashion website.\n\nUse:\n- generous vertical spacing\n- refined typography\n- subtle hierarchy\n- clean alignment\n- restrained borders/dividers\n- warm neutral background\n- excellent mobile spacing\n\nThe primary brand information should remain:\n\nPearls Elegance Thrift Abaya Wears\n\nThe agency credit should be secondary but clearly visible:\n\nDesigned & Engineered by Namaco Technology Nigeria Limited.\n\nDo not make the agency credit look like an advertisement.\n\nDo not use:\n- bullet separators\n- excessive icons\n- oversized text\n- unnecessary badges\n- excessive borders\n- large empty areas\n- decorative clutter\n\n==================================================\nTYPOGRAPHY\n==================================================\n\nUse the existing brand typography system:\n\nCormorant Garamond:\n- only where appropriate for brand/editorial elements\n\nPlus Jakarta Sans:\n- copyright\n- agency credit\n- location\n- footer navigation/information\n\nThe footer text should be understated and elegant.\n\n==================================================\nRESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR\n==================================================\n\nOn desktop:\n- Keep the footer spacious and balanced.\n- Align content precisely with the main site container.\n\nOn mobile:\n- Stack the information naturally.\n- Center-align where appropriate.\n- Prevent awkward wrapping.\n- Make sure the agency credit remains readable.\n- No horizontal overflow.\n\nTest at:\n320px\n375px\n390px\n430px\n768px\n1024px\n1280px\n1440px\n\n==================================================\nFINAL DETAIL\n==================================================\n\nThe footer should feel intentional and complete \342\200\224 like the final detail of a website designed by a professional digital studio.\n\nDo not redesign unrelated sections.\nOnly refine the footer and its responsive behavior.\n\nMake the final footer feel:\nquiet\nconfident\npremium\nminimal\nfinished"
    }
  }
